cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RSVS in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RSVS: Relational Symbolic Vocabulary System"
version: "8.3.0"
authors:
  - name: "Wolfvin"
    orcid: "0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >
  RSVS is a compositional symbolic meaning engine with a Rust core and
  Python API. It provides traceable, compositional sense definitions,
  structural similarity, substitution analysis, and autonomous tiered
  memory lifecycle — designed for neuro-symbolic AI and multilingual NLP
  with a focus on Bahasa Indonesia.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Wolfvin/SymbolicPuzzle3D"
